soft’s Cloud explainer video. Clear, trustworthy delivery that drives tech engagement. Need a VO? Let’s talk!\",\"uploadDate\":\"2018-01-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Microsoft Cloud Explainer Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Explainer Voiceover for Microsoft – Advertising the Cloud</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><strong>Trusted Voice for Conversational Explainer Videos</strong></h2>  \r\n<p>Explainer videos need to feel natural, confident, and easy to follow – and that’s exactly where I come in. My work with <strong>Microsoft</strong> on a video advertising their Cloud services is a perfect example of my <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceovers\">conversational explainer style</a>. I’ve also delivered the iconic <a href=\"/apple-voice-style\" title=\"Apple Voice Style\">Apple-style voiceovers</a>, showcasing my ability to sound clear, calm, and genuinely human – ideal for tech brands who want to connect with real people.</p>\r\n"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LRvWnpX_c9g","title":"Microsoft Cloud Explainer Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/microsoft-cloud-explainer-video.jpg","alt":"microsoft-cloud-explainer-video","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><strong>Microsoft Cloud – Explaining the Future</strong></h2>  \r\n<p>While the video itself is from a few years back, it still stands as a strong piece in my portfolio. The brief? A <strong>natural and engaging voiceover</strong> that could break down Microsoft’s Cloud offering for a broad audience. No jargon overload. No robotic tone. Just a real, human delivery that helps people understand the tech. That’s where my voice really fits.</p>\r\n"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><strong>Need a Conversational Explainer Voice?</strong></h2>  \r\n<p>If you’re creating a video that needs to sound natural, clear, and relatable, I can help. For bookings and availability, <a href=\"mailto:guy@Voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=VoiceoverGuy Website Enquiry\" title=\"Email Guy direct now\">Get in touch</a> today.</p>\r\n"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Microsoft Cloud Explainer Voiceover","pageUrl":"microsoft-cloud-explainer-video"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","868",{"href":"/traxart-explainer-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/traxart-explainer-voiceover.jpg","alt":"traxart-explainer-voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Traxart Explainer Video Voiceover "}]]}],["$","$L3","1",{"href":"/pirate-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children